{
  "_comment": [
    "网页版 AI 站点适配配置（Web AI Backend，见 docs/web-ai-backend-design.md）。",
    "架构参考 chen-squared/browser-ai-bridge（MIT）的 providers/registry：",
    "  inputSelectors      输入框候选列表，按顺序取第一个可见的",
    "  sendButtonSelectors 发送按钮候选；全部不可点击时退化为按 Enter",
    "  responseSelectors   回复容器候选，应指向完整的 assistant 回复节点",
    "  busySelectors       是否仍在生成（如「停止生成」按钮）。★必须配准，否则忙闲判定失效",
    "  inputKind           'richtext' = contenteditable 富文本；'textarea' = 原生表单元素",
    "                      ⚠ 富文本走 execCommand + beforeinput/keydown 增强路径（见 qstFillRef），",
    "                        仅设 value / 仅派发 input 事件对它无效",
    "  fileInputSelectors  传图用：页面上的 <input type=file> 候选（含 open shadow root 里搜）。",
    "                      ⚠ 留空也能工作：扩展会全文档兜底搜 input[type=file]。",
    "  fileButtonSelectors 传图兜底：找不到现成 input 时，点它来**唤出**文件选择器",
    "                      （扩展用 Page.setInterceptFileChooserDialog 拦住选择器再挂文件）。",
    "                      富文本站点常见形态：input 是点按钮时动态创建、用完即删。",
    "  newChatUrl           ★ 开新对话的入口 URL。宿主每轮判定「这是新对话」时会把自己的",
    "                      标签页导航到这里，拿到**干净上下文**（不复用用户自己的长对话）。",
    "                      留空则退回 url。⚠ 必须是「新建对话」的地址，不是某个会话的地址。",
    "selector 优先级：aria-label / data-testid / role > placeholder / name / type > class",
    "  ❌ 禁止编译产物类名（.c3f91a._ab12），随版本变化",
    "站点改版时改这份配置，不要改代码。"
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "providers": {
    "doubao": {
      "label": "豆包",
      "url": "https://www.doubao.com/chat/",
      "newChatUrl": "https://www.doubao.com/chat/",
      "urlHint": "doubao.com",
      "inputSelectors": [
        "textarea[data-testid='chat_input_input']",
        "div[contenteditable='true'][role='textbox']",
        "div[contenteditable='true']",
        "textarea"
      ],
      "inputKind": "richtext",
      "sendButtonSelectors": [
        "button[data-testid='chat_input_send_button']",
        "button[aria-label*='发送']",
        "button[aria-label*='Send']"
      ],
      "responseSelectors": [
        "[data-testid='receive_message']",
        "[class*='message'][class*='assistant']",
        ".ds-markdown",
        "div[data-testid='message_text_content']"
      ],
      "busySelectors": [
        "button[aria-label*='停止']",
        "button[aria-label*='Stop']",
        "[data-testid='chat_input_stop_button']",
        "[data-testid='chat_input_stop']",
        "[class*='thinking']",
        "[class*='generating']",
        "[class*='processing']"
      ],
      "fileInputSelectors": [
        "input[type='file'][accept*='image']",
        "input[type='file']"
      ],
      "fileButtonSelectors": [
        "[data-testid='chat_input_upload_button']",
        "button[aria-label*='上传']",
        "button[aria-label*='附件']",
        "button[aria-label*='Upload']",
        "[class*='upload'] button",
        "[class*='attach'] button"
      ],
      "readyTimeoutMs": 15000,
      "submissionSignalTimeoutMs": 8000,
      "progressIdleTimeoutMs": 30000,
      "maxGenerationTimeoutMs": 600000
    },
    "deepseek": {
      "label": "DeepSeek",
      "url": "https://chat.deepseek.com/",
      "newChatUrl": "https://chat.deepseek.com/",
      "urlHint": "chat.deepseek.com",
      "inputSelectors": [
        "textarea",
        "div[contenteditable='true'][role='textbox']"
      ],
      "inputKind": "textarea",
      "sendButtonSelectors": [
        "button[type='submit']",
        "button[aria-label*='发送']",
        "button[aria-label*='Send']"
      ],
      "responseSelectors": [
        ".ds-markdown",
        "[class*='assistant']"
      ],
      "busySelectors": [
        "button[aria-label*='停止']",
        "button[aria-label*='Stop']"
      ],
      "fileInputSelectors": [
        "input[type='file']"
      ],
      "fileButtonSelectors": [
        "button[aria-label*='上传']",
        "button[aria-label*='附件']",
        "button[aria-label*='Upload']",
        "[class*='upload'] button"
      ],
      "readyTimeoutMs": 15000,
      "submissionSignalTimeoutMs": 8000,
      "progressIdleTimeoutMs": 30000,
      "maxGenerationTimeoutMs": 600000
    },
    "yuanbao": {
      "label": "腾讯元宝",
      "url": "https://yuanbao.tencent.com/",
      "newChatUrl": "https://yuanbao.tencent.com/",
      "urlHint": "yuanbao.tencent.com",
      "inputSelectors": [
        "div[contenteditable='true'][role='textbox']",
        "div[contenteditable='true']",
        "textarea"
      ],
      "inputKind": "richtext",
      "sendButtonSelectors": [
        "a[class*='send']",
        "button[aria-label*='发送']",
        "button[aria-label*='Send']"
      ],
      "responseSelectors": [
        "[class*='hyc-content-markdown']",
        "[class*='agent-chat__bubble'] [class*='markdown']"
      ],
      "busySelectors": [
        "a[class*='stop']",
        "button[aria-label*='停止']"
      ],
      "fileInputSelectors": [
        "input[type='file']"
      ],
      "fileButtonSelectors": [
        "[class*='upload'] a",
        "[class*='upload'] button",
        "a[aria-label*='上传']",
        "button[aria-label*='上传']"
      ],
      "readyTimeoutMs": 15000,
      "submissionSignalTimeoutMs": 8000,
      "progressIdleTimeoutMs": 30000,
      "maxGenerationTimeoutMs": 600000
    },
    "qwen": {
      "_note": [
        "⚠ 2026-09-25 由用户提供入口 https://www.qianwen.com/（已核实是阿里官方域名：",
        "  tongyi.aliyun.com/qianwen/ 与 www.qianwen.com 返回同一个官方落地页）。",
        "⚠ 但**对话页的确切路径与输入框 selector 尚未真机标定** ——",
        "  搜索「通义千问 网页版」时前排混着 cn.qianwen-ail.com.cn 这类**仿冒域名**，",
        "  所以这里只用用户确认过的官方域名，selectors 用通用候选，待真机跑一次再校准。",
